nk:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-42\"></use><use data-c=\"4D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4D\" transform=\"translate(708,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>. The numerical value of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.294ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 572 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D465\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D465\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is __________.</p>",
